  Read the group rows, not the single-feature rows, for the decision:
  the trio and the pair are correlated, and single-feature shuffles
  share their joint credit unpredictably. If the microstructure pair's
  interval sits clear of zero at a size comparable to the trio's, it is
  pulling real weight and basis is worth building. If it is near zero,
  the skill is the volatility features and basis drops in priority.
  No threshold was set in advance for 'comparable', so this is read,
  not gated.

